1. Create an HTML file (e.g., `image_with_caption.html`) and add the following code:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Image with Caption</title>
  <style>
    #img-container {
      text-align: center;
    }
    #img-container img {
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }
    #img-container p {
      margin: 0;
      font-style: italic;
    }
